/-- **`evalNonSelectIntrinsicCall_alignOfVal_sized`**: `align_of_val` on a sized `pointeeTy`
with a thin pointer `.ptr p 8` writes `.scalar ⟨alignBytes, 8⟩`. -/
theorem evalNonSelectIntrinsicCall_alignOfVal_sized (s : MachineState)
